;; The expectations of the file parsing tests of web-platform-tests, at
;; commit 38d608e1005d6d7f0fecefb3b7b14109ab3c3b1d, which dev/fetch.sh
;; checks out. They're translated by hand from the JavaScript assertions
;; in webvtt/parsing/file-parsing/support/*.test, and from the two tests
;; written by hand in webvtt/parsing/file-parsing/tests (header-regions and
;; regions-edge-case). Under the 3-Clause BSD License of web-platform-tests,
;; which is in LICENSE.md next to this file.
;;
;; :cues has a key for each input in webvtt/parsing/file-parsing/tests/support,
;; without its .vtt. Its value has a map for each cue that the file must
;; parse into, of the VTTCue attributes that the test checks, as VTTCue has
;; them. A :region is a map of the VTTRegion attributes that the test
;; checks, or nil when the cue must have no region.
;;
;; :not-webvtt names the inputs in webvtt/parsing/file-parsing/support that
;; signature-invalid.html expects to fail to load.
{:commit "38d608e1005d6d7f0fecefb3b7b14109ab3c3b1d"

 :not-webvtt
 ["empty" "signature-formfeed" "signature-invalid-whitespace" "signature-invalid"
  "signature-lowercase" "signature-missing-whitespace" "signature-missing"
  "signature-null" "signature-partial" "signature-two-boms" "signature-websrt"]

